# .agentignore — files an agent must NOT read at session start (token economy).
# Each entry is literal; the line above explains why it is excluded.

# docs/SKILLS.md — 200+ KB human catalog, never read at connect
docs/SKILLS.md

# research/ — historical surveys, read only when researching new skills
research/

# publish/ — npm/PyPI packaging, not runtime
publish/

# tools/reports/*.py — report generators, not runtime validation
tools/reports/*.py

# /evals/README.md — eval instructions, read only when running evals
/evals/README.md
